            "C": "Refine the fastest measured pipeline, 8087bf3fada8499d. Compare up to four workers, strip widths, and row-batch sizes around 16 to balance startup latency, synchronization, and locality. Investigate bounded spinning versus yielding without changing runtime permissions. Preserve release/acquire publication of immutable edge values and correctness when the actual OpenMP team is smaller than requested. Retain a measured serial fallback.",
