          "depth": 1,
          "epoch": 1,
          "hypothesis": "The outer target-body iterations have no loop-carried dependency: each reads positions and writes only its own velocity. A GCC vectorization hint may enable SIMD across targets while leaving each target's sequential j accumulation order intact.",
