            ],
            "retained": [
              "Replace per-iteration serial force and integration loops with one OpenMP parallel region spanning all N_ITER iterations.",
              "Workshare target-body force and position-integration loops with schedule(static), retaining the implicit barriers between force calculation and integration and between iterations.",
              "Use an OpenMP serial region when nbodies is below the generic threshold of 64.",
              "Extract the original ascending-j force accumulation into a per-target helper so each target retains its arithmetic order."
            ]
