          "data": {
            "A": "Research a matrix-free Kitamasa candidate. Use the recurrence polynomial x^N - P1*x^(N-1) - ... - PN and compute x^(H-1) modulo it; combine the resulting coefficients with A1..AN. Target O(N^2 log H) work and O(N) storage instead of dense O(N^3 log(H-N)) matrix powers. Check indexing and modular arithmetic carefully, including N=1, and benchmark against the existing implementation.",
