              "src/npbonacci.cpp"
            ],
            "retained": [
              "Compute x^(H-1) modulo the characteristic polynomial using left-to-right squaring and O(N) multiplication by x, then take its dot product with A.",
              "Replace fixed-size matrices with contiguous 32-bit residue arrays and reusable scratch storage; reverse P once for ascending-degree reduction.",
              "Use symmetric convolution, active-length bounds and contiguous descending-degree reduction updates.",
              "Use an exact circular-history recurrence for short horizons, traversing each window as two contiguous spans and selecting it through a generic operation-count estimate."
            ]
          },
