          "epoch": 1,
          "hypothesis": "Stable byte-radix passes with independent histogram banks can outperform branch-heavy partitioning. Disjoint worker bucket ranges permit race-free parallel scatter, while only the independent histogram reduction is annotated for SIMD.",
