          "epoch": 1,
          "hypothesis": "For graph orders large enough to amortize OpenMP overhead, parallel validation of contiguous batches of Heap-order permutations can reduce search time while preserving the exact permutation output sequence. Small searches remain serial.",
          "id": "0955c5fa2aec4a67",
