            "retained": [
              "Added one four-thread OpenMP parallel region with static work-sharing for independent column loops; retained a serial team for inputs below the generic sorting-work threshold.",
              "Replaced the quadratic mode scan for sorted finite columns with a linear run-length scan, using a pairwise fallback if a column contains NaN values; ties keep the first longest run and columns without duplicates return -1."
            ]
          },
