          "depth": 1,
          "epoch": 1,
          "hypothesis": "A persistent OpenMP team, entered only when the BFS frontier reaches 32 states, can amortize per-layer team startup and speed wide layers on four cores. Contiguous static parent ranges and serial candidate merging in the existing parent/direction order preserve deterministic duplicate handling and solution tie-breaking.",
          "id": "7d20e1bd7ba04bcf",
          "ordinal": 2,
          "parent_id": null,
          "role": "C",
