            ],
            "retained": [
              "Count bucket sizes and assign prefix-offset slices before filling indices, avoiding fixed-size per-bucket storage under skewed inputs.",
              "Replace insertion sort with in-place heapsort to bound each bucket's sorting work by O(m log m).",
              "Parallelize independent bucket sorts with OpenMP dynamic scheduling and skip team creation for small inputs or a single bucket.",
              "Free bucket descriptors after sorting to avoid retaining per-call allocations."
            ]
