          "depth": 1,
          "epoch": 1,
          "hypothesis": "Dynamically sharing independent column bands across at most four OpenMP workers should reduce runtime for larger inputs while per-worker frequency maps and a 64-bit reduction preserve exact counts. A work estimate leaves small inputs on the serial path to avoid parallel startup overhead.",
          "id": "5707ad4f722748d4",
