          "depth": 1,
          "epoch": 1,
          "hypothesis": "A tiled in-place RHS transpose should replace the multiplication kernel's strided RHS reads with contiguous dot-product reads. Bounded 16-product partial sums preserve exact modular arithmetic while reducing the number of reductions.",
