            "C": "Research a faster exact permutation verifier: compare contiguous byte or packed-bit adjacency representations, precompute reusable row/signature data, and reduce per-candidate lookup overhead without changing which permutations are emitted or their order. Measure the full program, including representation setup, rather than assuming the verifier is the bottleneck.",
