            ],
            "retained": [
              "Fuse independent per-column mean, harmonic mean, sort, median, mode, variance, standard deviation, and coefficient-of-variation work into one per-column function.",
              "Use schedule(static) OpenMP work sharing for sufficiently large workloads with at least four columns; retain a serial path below the threshold and when OpenMP is unavailable.",
              "Compute mode from equal-value runs after sorting, maintaining first-in-sorted-order tie handling."
            ]
