          "depth": 1,
          "epoch": 1,
          "hypothesis": "Static OpenMP work sharing over independent column sorts can speed up sufficiently large sort workloads while a comparison-count threshold keeps small workloads serial; initializing mode counters also makes mode results deterministic.",
