          "hypothesis": "Replacing quadratic bubble sorting with a stable O(n log n) merge sort for NaN-free columns should reduce sorting cost without changing sorted order or metric results. Combining this with archived input-time mean accumulation, sorted-run mode counting, and independent-loop vectorization may improve the full program; NaN-containing columns retain the original bubble-sort ordering.",
