            ],
            "retained": [
              "Count records per bucket and prefix-sum counts to create exact contiguous bucket ranges.",
              "Scatter indices into those ranges in input order.",
              "Sort each range with stable iterative mergesort using one reusable scratch array and strcmp comparisons."
