            ],
            "retained": [
              "Read row slabs, block-transpose them into column storage, and accumulate arithmetic and reciprocal sums in original row order.",
              "Reuse ingestion workspace for stable merges of insertion-sorted blocks, sorting NaN-separated spans independently.",
              "Complete median, mode, variance and derived statistics one column at a time.",
              "Replace quadratic mode comparisons with equal-run scanning, retaining float-count rounding behavior and a deterministic comparison fallback for NaNs or unsorted callers."
            ]
